1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,360
W: Aren't you ready yet?

2
00:00:01,620 --> 00:00:03,200
We have to take off soon, you know.

3
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:09,680
The rain out there is starting to really come down hard, and the traffic on the road is probably going to be chaotic.

4
00:00:10,340 --> 00:00:10,780
M: I know.

5
00:00:10,940 --> 00:00:11,840
Just give me a second.

6
00:00:12,260 --> 00:00:15,975
I have to take this paper up to Mr. Kim's office before we take off.

7
00:00:16,320 --> 00:00:19,540
Tell you what: why don't I meet you in the lobby in five minutes?

8
00:00:20,040 --> 00:00:23,265
This way, I can go back to my office to get my coat as well.

9
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:26,220
W: All right, Bob, but hurry up, please.

10
00:00:27,090 --> 00:00:31,740
This is our first meeting with Mr. Rowe, and I don't want to give him the wrong impression by being late.

11
00:00:32,060 --> 00:00:33,025
M: Don't worry.

12
00:00:33,190 --> 00:00:34,400
We still have plenty of time.

13
00:00:34,870 --> 00:00:39,660
Besides, we are going to take the subway, so you don't have to worry about getting stuck in traffic.
